e/interpreter/functions/math.test.ts::does not collect across an internal hole or restart poisoned recurrence\"\n+  ],\n+  \"FE-EMA-FINITE-COMPAT\": [\n+    \"server/test/formula-engine/interpreter/functions/math.test.ts::preserves exact frozen old vectors for uninterrupted valid inputs\",\n+    \"server/test/formula-engine/interpreter/functions/math.test.ts::retains later non finite propagation and never skips leading Infinity\"\n+  ],\n+  \"FE-EMA-NESTED\": [\n+    \"server/test/formula-engine/integration/FormulaEngine.test.ts::evaluates nested EMA3 with four warmup NaNs then the hand values 3 4 5\"\n+  ],\n+  \"FE-EMA-QINIU-DEA\": [\n+    \"server/test/formula-seed.test.ts::真实 QINIU seed 在引擎和服务端保留 DIF25 DEA33 暖机与线性 B1 全零\",\n+    \"server/test/formula-chart.test.ts::真实 QINIU 图表输出 DIF25 DEA33 后为7且前段null与B1全零\"\n+  ],\n+  \"FE-EMA-QINIU-CROSS\": [\n+    \"server/test/formula-engine/integration/FormulaEngine.test.ts::evaluates the real QINIU wave DEA against independent weights and B1 only at 61 and 93\"\n+  ]\n+}"},{"sha":"0972e8a505ea12781d9a923e092e2f5d93a580fc","filename":"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01/artifacts/workflow-state.json","status":"added","additions":1174,"deletions":0,"changes":1174,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/docs%2Fverification%2F2026-11%2FM9-EMA-WARMUP-01%2Fartifacts%2Fworkflow-state.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/docs%2Fverification%2F2026-11%2FM9-EMA-WARMUP-01%2Fartifacts%2Fworkflow-state.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/docs%2Fverification%2F2026-11%2FM9-EMA-WARMUP-01%2Fartifacts%2Fworkflow-state.json?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,1174 @@\n+\n+> a-share-kline-trainer@1.3.8 workflow:state\n+> tsx scripts/workflow/state-cli.ts task --control-root D:/Superlinear_Academy/Stock_WorkS