/docs%2Fwork-items%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/docs%2Fwork-items%2FREADME.md?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -1,5 +1,7 @@\n # 任务与阶段\n \n+- [M9-EMA-WARMUP-01 公共 EMA 暖机](tasks/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md)：用户已批准独立修复前导 NaN，保持正常输入结果和现有断言；专项回归和独立审查后，由 M9 统一完成最终整批及 Windows 包验收。\n+\n - [ENG-PLAN-01 首批计划与任务对账](tasks/ENG-PLAN-01.md)：[批准记录](../verification/2026-11/ENG-PLAN-01/approval.md)、[22卡事实与旧E2E静态对账](../verification/2026-11/ENG-PLAN-01/README.md)；产品当前动态结果和新增用户验收未验证。\n \n - [ENG-HEALTH-02 工程健康检查](tasks/ENG-HEALTH-02.md)：2026-11-17 本地/GitHub 对账、过时跟踪引用与文档整理；[检查记录和后续清单](../verification/2026-11/ENG-HEALTH-02/README.md)。"},{"sha":"1b15dab6ef4a8828763aee315fc7458ed0a70280","filename":"docs/work-items/milestones/M9.md","status":"modified","additions":5,"deletions":3,"changes":8,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/docs%2Fwork-items%2Fmilestones%2FM9.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/docs%2Fwork-items%2Fmilestones%2FM9.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/docs%2Fwork-items%2Fmilestones%2FM9.md?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -6,18 +6,19 @@\n   \"title\": \"公式系统（通达信兼容公式引擎）\",\n   \"state\": \"active\",\n   \"summary\": \"以功能全面性为目标、在开源 formula-ts 上自研补足的通达信兼容公式引擎：M9-01/02/03 已完成工程验证（review）；M9-04 A 公式库、B 管理 UI、C 图表挂载、D 内置示例与本地只读 agent 接口均已由 PR #44–47 合入 main（review），整批候选与用户验收待组织。首批仅图表显示，不做选股扫描/条件单联动。\",\n-  \"task_ids\": [\"M9-01\", \"M9-02\", \"M9-03\", \"M9-04A\", \"M9-04B\", \"M9-04C\", \"M9-04D\"],\n+  \"task_ids\": [\"M9-01\", \"M9-02\", \"M9-03\", \"M9-04A\", \"M9-04B\", \"M9-04C\", \"M9-04D\", \"M9-EMA-WARMUP-01\"],\n   \"verification_refs\": [\n     \"docs/verification/2026-10/M9-01/README.md\",\n     \"docs/verification/2026-10/M9-02/README.md\",\n     \"docs/verification/2026-10/M9-03/README.md\",\n     \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-04A/README.md\",\n     \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-04B/README.md\",\n     \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-04C/README.md\",\n-    \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-04D/README.md\"\n+    \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-04D/README.md\",\n+    \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01/README.md\"\n   ],\n   \"acceptance_ref\": null,\n-  \"next_action\": \"组织 M9-04 A-D 整批集成候选；先明确内置示例默认停用且缺少 UI 启停入口的后继口径，再按整批门禁和人工验收清单交付。未授权不发布。\"\n+  \"next_action\": \"内置示例默认停用、用户逐个开启的口径已批准；启停保存由 M9-ENABLE-01 接续。用户2026-11-18批准独立EMA前导NaN暖机修复，先完成专项回归与审查，再由最终统一候选执行M9整批、主代理视觉和Windows实包验收；未获人工验收，不发布。\"\n }\n ```\n \n@@ -35,6 +36,7 @@\n | [M9-04B](../tasks/M9-04B.md) | 公式管理 UI（设置分栏：列表/编辑/校验提示/粘贴导入/预览/删除） | review（PR #45 已合并 main fd017dc；整批待用户验收） |\n | [M9-04C](../tasks/M9-04C.md) | 图表挂载（主图叠加＋副图窗格；周期/推进/补历史/录像回放） | review（PR #46 已合并 main fef6293；整批待用户验收） |\n | [M9-04D](../tasks/M9-04D.md) | 内置示例公式与本地只读 agent 接口文档/CLI | review（PR #47 已合并 main 3b5fb11；整批待用户验收） |\n+| [M9-EMA-WARMUP-01](../tasks/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md) | 用户批准的公共 EMA 前导 NaN 暖机例外 | review；专项/真实语料/完整单测及独立审查已通过，M9 整批交付待执行 |\n \n ## 验收基线\n "},{"sha":"55d88c55799e2c233c092bd4150d25685541c362","filename":"docs/work-items/tasks/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md","status":"added","additions":63,"deletions":0,"changes":63,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/docs%2Fwork-items%2Ftasks%2FM9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/docs%2Fwork-items%2Ftasks%2FM9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/docs%2Fwork-items%2Ftasks%2FM9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,63 @@\n+# M9-EMA-WARMUP-01 公共 EMA 前导空值暖机\n+\n+```json\n+{\n+  \"id\": \"M9-EMA-WARMUP-01\",\n+  \"title\": \"修复公共EMA前导NaN暖机并保留正常输入结果\",\n+  \"owner\": \"integrator\",\n+  \"state\": \"review\",\n+  \"milestone\": \"M9\",\n+  \"base_commit\": \"df6cedd82fa3fe591615724259f83d16f6bb70fa\",\n+  \"summary\": \"公共EMA前导NaN暖机已完成：专项112项、真实语料43项、完整server2664＋desktop369同次3033项通过；回退修复8项语义失败，独立五维审查可合入。仅正整数周期契约，M9整批/Windows包/用户验收另行执行。\",\n+  \"next_action\": \"经文档和矩阵最终门禁后走独立PR合入；M9-ENABLE-01集成同一修复后运行最终整批候选、主代理视觉与Windows实包录像回放，交用户验收。\",\n+  \"allowed_paths\": [\n+    \"web/src/formula-engine/interpreter/functions/math.ts\",\n+    \"server/test/formula-engine/interpreter/functions/math.test.ts\",\n+    \"server/test/formula-engine/integration/FormulaEngine.test.ts\",\n+    \"server/test/formula-seed.test.ts\",\n+    \"server/test/formula-chart.test.ts\",\n+    \"web/src/formula-engine/README.md\",\n+    \"docs/specs/formulas.md\",\n+    \"docs/specs/README.md\",\n+    \"docs/work-items/tasks/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md\",\n+    \"docs/work-items/milestones/M9.md\",\n+    \"docs/work-items/README.md\",\n+    \"docs/status.md\",\n+    \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01/**\"\n+  ],\n+  \"depends_on\": [\n+    \"DEP-SEC-MINIMATCH-01\"\n+  ],\n+  \"docs_impact\": {\n+    \"update\": [\n+      \"web/src/formula-engine/README.md\",\n+      \"docs/specs/formulas.md\",\n+      \"docs/specs/README.md\",\n+      \"docs/work-items/tasks/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md\",\n+      \"docs/work-items/milestones/M9.md\",\n+      \"docs/work-items/README.md\",\n+      \"docs/status.md\"\n+    ],\n+    \"reason\": \"公共EMA是冻结vendor语义的明确已批准例外，记录暖机边界、正常输入兼容性、实际回归和M9后继交付边界。root单写矩阵、统一状态和聚合文档。\"\n+  },\n+  \"verification_refs\": [\n+    \"docs/verification/2026-11/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01/README.md\"\n+  ],\n+  \"integration_ref\": null,\n+  \"acceptance_ref\": null\n+}\n+```\n+\n+批准来源为本轮用户对“是否批准新增独立的EMA前导空值暖机修复，保持正常输入结果和现有验收断言，通过专项回归后继续交付M9”的明确答复：“批准独立修复，再完成M9（建议）”。本卡只授予修复与继续开发，不授予发布或人工验收。\n+\n+冻结范围：首个非NaN输入位置后累积原连续N个位置，沿用逆序SMA种子、alpha=2/(N+1)和原递推。只跳过前导NaN；不跨内部空洞收集有效值，不重启内部NaN后的递推，不跳过Infinity，不改CROSS/IF、示例源码、其他EMA helper或内置MACD。\n+\n+独立预期：EMA([NaN,NaN,2,4,6,8],3)在索引4/5为4/6；嵌套EMA3在CLOSE=1..7上前4项为空、后3项为3/4/5；120根CLOSE=1..120的QINIU DIF从25起95值、DEA从33起87值且为7；固定起伏样本的B1在索引61/93。正常连续有效输入必须逐项保持旧数值，新增测试不能调用修改后的函数计算expected。\n+\n+矩阵由root预登记FE-EMA-LEADING-NAN、FE-EMA-FINITE-COMPAT、FE-EMA-NESTED、FE-EMA-QINIU-DEA、FE-EMA-QINIU-CROSS；worker不编辑矩阵或共享状态。保留旧FE-VENDOR-BASELINE和FE-CORPUS-SMOKE断言，冻结基线仅新增这项明确例外。\n+\n+TDD和验证：先保存专项原生RED，修复后执行函数/引擎/seed/chart测试；真实6文件和23语料不可跳过，独立npm ci/build后跑完整server+desktop。定向变异验证只回退本次EMA补丁，保留所有断言；确认RED后复原精确候选再绿。最终M9完整Journey、深浅主题视觉、Windows实包训练/公式/录像回放由root在合入后的统一候选执行。\n+\n+## 工程验证与后继\n+\n+专项 RED→GREEN、真实语料、完整3033项、实际变异及独立五维审查收据均已归档于[验证记录](../../verification/2026-11/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01/README.md)。首次原生崩溃和后续控制环境污染失败原样保留；正常输入浮点向量和旧验收断言保持。当前 review 表示独立修复具备集成条件，M9 浏览器/Windows包和人工验收没有由此转正。"},{"sha":"e3c7d7b5610afb646e9cad28523cc953a233101b","filename":"server/test/formula-chart.test.ts","status":"modified","additions":17,"deletions":0,"changes":17,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-chart.test.ts","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-chart.test.ts","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-chart.test.ts?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@\n import { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'\n import type { Bar, FormulaView } from '../../web/src/api'\n+import { BUILTIN_FORMULAS } from '../src/formulas/seed.js'\n import {\n   barTimestamp, evaluateFormulaChart, formulaIndicatorName, formulaPaneIdsOf,\n   isFormulaIndicatorName, paneHeightsForCapture,\n@@ -25,6 +26,22 @@ function formula(overrides: Partial<FormulaView> = {}): FormulaView {\n }\n \n describe('M9-04C 公式图表求值（浏览器侧纯函数）', () => {\n+  it('真实 QINIU 图表输出 DIF25 DEA33 后为7且前段null与B1全零', () => {\n+    const bars = Array.from({ length: 120 }, (_, index) => ({\n+      date: new Date(Date.UTC(2026, 0, index + 1)).toISOString().slice(0, 10),\n+      open: index + 1, high: index + 2, low: index, close: index + 1, volume: 1000, amount: 1000,\n+    }))\n+    const builtin = BUILTIN_FORMULAS.find(item => item.name === 'QINIU_B1_SUB')!\n+    const renders = evaluateFormulaChart({ bars, formulas: [formula({ ...builtin, builtin: true, enabled: true })] })\n+    expect(renders).toHaveLength(1)\n+    expect(renders[0].error).toBeNull()\n+    expect(renders[0].lines.map(line => line.name)).toEqual(['DIF', 'DEA', 'B1'])\n+    expect(renders[0].lines[0].points.map(point => point.value)).toEqual([...Array(25).fill(null), ...Array(95).fill(7)])\n+    expect(renders[0].lines[1].points.map(point => point.value)).toEqual([...Array(33).fill(null), ...Array(87).fill(7)])\n+    expect(renders[0].lines[2].points.map(point => point.value)).toEqual(Array(120).fill(0))\n+    expect(renders[0].lines[1].points.map(point => point.timestamp)).toEqual(bars.map(bar => barTimestamp(bar.date)))\n+  })\n+\n   it('图表 timestamp 统一 UTC 午夜（与 KlineChart dateTimestamp 同源）', () => {\n     expect(barTimestamp('2026-01-05')).toBe(Date.parse('2026-01-05T00:00:00Z'))\n     expect(barTimestamp('2026-01')).toBe(Date.parse('2026-01-01T00:00:00Z'))"},{"sha":"51621b1f1b57a73dfde30fe6a042e6f3c5da4a6b","filename":"server/test/formula-engine/integration/FormulaEngine.test.ts","status":"modified","additions":48,"deletions":0,"changes":48,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-engine%2Fintegration%2FFormulaEngine.test.ts","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-engine%2Fintegration%2FFormulaEngine.test.ts","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-engine%2Fintegration%2FFormulaEngine.test.ts?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -2,6 +2,54 @@ import { describe, it, expect, beforeEach } from 'vitest';\n import { FormulaEngine } from '../../../../web/src/formula-engine/FormulaEngine';\n import { MarketData } from '../../../../web/src/formula-engine/types/MarketData';\n import { LexerError, ParserError } from '../../../../web/src/formula-engine/errors';\n+import { BUILTIN_FORMULAS } from '../../../src/formulas/seed.js';\n+\n+describe('M9 EMA composition regression', () => {\n+  function barsFor(closes: number[]): MarketData[] {\n+    return closes.map((close, index) => ({\n+      timestamp: Date.UTC(2026, 0, index + 1), open: close, high: close + 1,\n+      low: close - 1, close, volume: 1000,\n+    }));\n+  }\n+\n+  it('evaluates nested EMA3 with four warmup NaNs then the hand values 3 4 5', () => {\n+    const result = new FormulaEngine().evaluate('X:EMA(EMA(CLOSE,3),3);', barsFor([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]));\n+    expect(result.outputs[0].data).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN, 3, 4, 5]);\n+  });\n+\n+  it('evaluates the real QINIU wave DEA against independent weights and B1 only at 61 and 93', () => {\n+    const closes = Array.from({ length: 120 }, (_, index) => 50 + 10 * Math.sin(index / 5) + 0.05 * index);\n+    // Independent closed-form weights, with explicit approved seed indexes.\n+    // No production EMA, helper or recurrence is used to calculate expected.\n+    function weightedOracle(data: number[], period: number, seedIndex: number): number[] {\n+      const values = Array(data.length).fill(NaN);\n+      const seed = data.slice(seedIndex - period + 1, seedIndex + 1).reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0) / period;\n+      const alpha = 2 / (period + 1);\n+      const decay = 1 - alpha;\n+      for (let index = seedIndex; index < data.length; index += 1) {\n+        let value = seed * decay ** (index - seedIndex);\n+        for (let input = seedIndex + 1; input <= index; input += 1) {\n+          value += alpha * data[input] * decay ** (index - input);\n+        }\n+        values[index] = value;\n+      }\n+      return values;\n+    }\n+    const fast = weightedOracle(closes, 12, 11);\n+    const slow = weightedOracle(closes, 26, 25);\n+    const dif = fast.map((value, index) => value - slow[index]);\n+    const dea = weightedOracle(dif, 9, 33);\n+    const source = BUILTIN_FORMULAS.find(item => item.name === 'QINIU_B1_SUB')!.source;\n+    const result = new FormulaEngine().evaluate(source, barsFor(closes));\n+    expect(result.outputs.map(line => line.name)).toEqual(['DIF', 'DEA', 'B1']);\n+    const actualDea = result.outputs.find(line => line.name === 'DEA')!.data;\n+    expect(actualDea.slice(0, 33)).toEqual(Array(33).fill(NaN));\n+    expect(actualDea.slice(33)).toHaveLength(87);\n+    for (let index = 33; index < closes.length; index += 1) expect(actualDea[index]).toBeCloseTo(dea[index], 10);\n+    const b1 = result.outputs.find(line => line.name === 'B1')!.data;\n+    expect(b1).toEqual(Array.from({ length: 120 }, (_, index) => index === 61 || index === 93 ? 1 : 0));\n+  });\n+});\n \n describe('FormulaEngine - End-to-End Integration Tests', () => {\n   let engine: FormulaEngine;"},{"sha":"6fe628e0d4ee493134a7f5be1e4ebdb6ff1a34a3","filename":"server/test/formula-engine/interpreter/functions/math.test.ts","status":"modified","additions":43,"deletions":0,"changes":43,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-engine%2Finterpreter%2Ffunctions%2Fmath.test.ts","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-engine%2Finterpreter%2Ffunctions%2Fmath.test.ts","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-engine%2Finterpreter%2Ffunctions%2Fmath.test.ts?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -1,6 +1,49 @@\n import { describe, it, expect } from 'vitest';\n import { MA, EMA, SUM, MAX, MIN, ABS, SQRT, POW, MOD, ROUND } from '../../../../../web/src/formula-engine/interpreter/functions/math';\n \n+describe('M9 EMA warmup contract', () => {\n+  it('seeds after only the leading NaN prefix with the hand calculated SMA', () => {\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, NaN, 2, 4, 6, 8], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN, 4, 6]);\n+  });\n+\n+  it('keeps empty all NaN and insufficient post prefix inputs unseeded', () => {\n+    expect(EMA([], 3)).toEqual([]);\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN]);\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, NaN, 2, 4], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN]);\n+  });\n+\n+  it('warms period one after leading NaN without restarting after a later NaN', () => {\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, NaN, 2, 4, NaN, 8], 1)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, 2, 4, NaN, NaN]);\n+  });\n+\n+  it('does not collect across an internal hole or restart poisoned recurrence', () => {\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, 2, NaN, 6, 8, 10], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN, NaN]);\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, 2, 4, 6, NaN, 10, 12], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, 4, NaN, NaN, NaN]);\n+  });\n+\n+  it('preserves exact frozen old vectors for uninterrupted valid inputs', () => {\n+    // Frozen from df6cedd before this patch; expected values never call EMA.\n+    expect(EMA([2, 8, 4, 10, 0, 6], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, 4.666666666666667, 7.333333333333334, 3.666666666666667, 4.833333333333334]);\n+    expect(EMA([1e16, -1e16, 1, 4, 8, 2], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, 0, 2, 5, 3.5]);\n+    expect(EMA([1e16, 1, -1e16, 4], 1)).toEqual([1e16, 0, -1e16, 4]);\n+    expect(EMA([7, 7, 7, 7, 7], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, 7, 7, 7]);\n+    expect(EMA([1, 2], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN]);\n+    const wave = Array.from({ length: 32 }, (_, index) => 50 + 10 * Math.sin(index / 5) + 0.05 * index);\n+    expect(EMA(wave, 26)).toEqual([\n+      ...Array(25).fill(NaN), 51.81356923264605, 51.12111621117586, 50.565652426973216,\n+      50.15985103395867, 49.91126786150709, 49.82197728050736, 49.888431257642004,\n+    ]);\n+  });\n+\n+  it('retains later non finite propagation and never skips leading Infinity', () => {\n+    expect(EMA([2, 4, 6, NaN, 10, 12], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, 4, NaN, NaN, NaN]);\n+    expect(EMA([2, 4, 6, Infinity, 8, 10], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, 4, Infinity, NaN, NaN]);\n+    expect(EMA([2, 4, 6, -Infinity, 8, 10], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, 4, -Infinity, NaN, NaN]);\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, Infinity, 1, 2, 3], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, Infinity, NaN]);\n+    expect(EMA([NaN, -Infinity, 1, 2, 3], 3)).toEqual([NaN, NaN, NaN, -Infinity, NaN]);\n+  });\n+});\n+\n describe('Math Functions', () => {\n   describe('MA - Simple Moving Average', () => {\n     it('should calculate MA correctly for valid input', () => {"},{"sha":"b254646367287dc87f9b400aef7ce00bcacbbb88","filename":"server/test/formula-seed.test.ts","status":"modified","additions":24,"deletions":0,"changes":24,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-seed.test.ts","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-seed.test.ts","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/server%2Ftest%2Fformula-seed.test.ts?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -39,6 +39,30 @@ function syntheticBars(count: number): { bars: FormulaBar[]; dates: string[] } {\n }\n \n describe('M9-04D 内置示例公式 seed', () => {\n+  it('真实 QINIU seed 在引擎和服务端保留 DIF25 DEA33 暖机与线性 B1 全零', () => {\n+    const database = freshDatabase()\n+    try {\n+      seedBuiltinFormulas(database)\n+      const source = builtinRows(database).find(row => row.name === 'QINIU_B1_SUB')!.source\n+      const { bars, dates } = syntheticBars(120)\n+      const linear = bars.map((bar, index) => ({ ...bar, open: index + 1, high: index + 2, low: index, close: index + 1 }))\n+      const engine = new FormulaEngine().evaluate(source, linear)\n+      expect(engine.outputs.map(line => line.name)).toEqual(['DIF', 'DEA', 'B1'])\n+      expect(engine.outputs[0].data).toEqual([...Array(25).fill(NaN), ...Array(95).fill(7)])\n+      expect(engine.outputs[1].data).toEqual([...Array(33).fill(NaN), ...Array(87).fill(7)])\n+      expect(engine.outputs[2].data).toEqual(Array(120).fill(0))\n+      const server = evaluateOnBars(engineModule, { source, bars: linear, dates, limit: 120 })\n+      expect(server.ok).toBe(true)\n+      if (!server.ok) throw new Error('真实 QINIU seed 求值失败')\n+      expect(server.outputs.map(line => line.name)).toEqual(['DIF', 'DEA', 'B1'])\n+      expect(server.outputs[0].data).toEqual([...Array(25).fill(null), ...Array(95).fill(7)])\n+      expect(server.outputs[1].data).toEqual([...Array(33).fill(null), ...Array(87).fill(7)])\n+      expect(server.outputs[2].data).toEqual(Array(120).fill(0))\n+    } finally {\n+      database.close()\n+    }\n+  })\n+\n   it('空库幂等写入 3 个内置示例，重复 seed 不重复', () => {\n     const database = freshDatabase()\n     try {"},{"sha":"2c409c5516569614b6bc458de1613b8b304c0e79","filename":"web/src/formula-engine/README.md","status":"modified","additions":8,"deletions":0,"changes":8,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/web%2Fsrc%2Fformula-engine%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/web%2Fsrc%2Fformula-engine%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/web%2Fsrc%2Fformula-engine%2FREADME.md?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -62,6 +62,14 @@\n - `HYBLOCK` 返回字符串（非数值序列）：输出行 `X:HYBLOCK;`（数值输出位）会报 must be numeric——字符串仅作为 STRCAT/DRAWTEXT 文本路径的中间态，通达信同款用法。\n - 上下文函数未注册进 FunctionRegistry（其 execute 签名无法承载字符串/上下文），分发在 Interpreter switch＋Identifier 兜底，与 marketData 函数族（OPEN/CLOSE…）同模式。\n \n+## 公共 EMA 暖机（M9-EMA-WARMUP-01 批准例外）\n+\n+用户于 2026-11-18 明确批准公共 `interpreter/functions/math.ts::EMA` 的前导 NaN 修复，作为冻结基线的独立例外。本次契约适用于正整数周期 N；非法周期未新增数值校验。EMA 跳过前导 NaN，从首个非 NaN 位置起使用原数组连续 N 个位置的 SMA 播种；播种前仍为 NaN。全空或余下长度不足 N 时全为 NaN，N=1 同样遵循此规则。\n+\n+SMA 的逆序求和、`2/(N+1)` 系数及后续递推保持原运算，因此没有前导 NaN 的连续有效输入逐项保持原数值。内部 NaN 不被跨过或重启；Infinity 不被过滤，其后仍按原生算术传播。此补丁不定义空洞恢复策略，不修改其他 EMA helper、内置 MACD、CROSS/IF 或示例源码。\n+\n+嵌套 `EMA(EMA(CLOSE,3),3)` 在 CLOSE=1..7 时前四项为空，随后为 3/4/5。实际 QINIU 种子因此可以完成 DIF→DEA 的两次暖机；产品整批、图表视觉及包验收仍由 M9 后继验证负责。批准来源和验证事实见[任务卡](../../../docs/work-items/tasks/M9-EMA-WARMUP-01.md)及其 verification 入口。\n+\n ## 导出面\n \n 沿用上游 `index.ts` 结构（FormulaEngine、错误类、AST、核心组件、内置函数全量导出），另导出补丁层 `scanFutureFunctions` / `FUTURE_FUNCTIONS`（M9-01）、`crossPeriod.ts` 全部类型与纯函数（`resampleBars`/`broadcastReferenceLine`/`aggregateBars`/`FormulaEvaluationOptions` 等，M9-02）与 `marketContext.ts` 全部类型与纯函数（`StockContext`/`boardTypeOfCode`/`alignIndexField`/`prefixMatchSeries` 等，M9-03）。"},{"sha":"7eed4866a213d5de7b9c6eb5e6075be6ccc5ef36","filename":"web/src/formula-engine/interpreter/functions/math.ts","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":2,"changes":6,"blob_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/blob/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/web%2Fsrc%2Fformula-engine%2Finterpreter%2Ffunctions%2Fmath.ts","raw_url":"https://github.com/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/raw/58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8/web%2Fsrc%2Fformula-engine%2Finterpreter%2Ffunctions%2Fmath.ts","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m1kuStark/a-share-kline-trainer/contents/web%2Fsrc%2Fformula-engine%2Finterpreter%2Ffunctions%2Fmath.ts?ref=58ba0ffc13458fb136c7d885b62ee0c898d4bab8","patch":"@@ -38,14 +38,16 @@ export function MA(data: number[], period: number): number[] {\n export function EMA(data: number[], period: number): number[] {\n   const result: number[] = new Array(data.length);\n   const multiplier = 2 / (period + 1);\n+  const firstValidIndex = data.findIndex(value => !Number.isNaN(value));\n+  const seedIndex = firstValidIndex === -1 ? data.length : firstValidIndex + period - 1;\n \n   for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i++) {\n-    if (i < period - 1) {\n+    if (i < seedIndex) {\n       result[i] = NaN;\n       continue;\n     }\n \n-    if (i === period - 1) {\n+    if (i === seedIndex) {\n       // First EMA value = SMA\n       let sum = 0;\n       for (let j = 0; j < period; j++) {"}]}